{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long-form RPG years in the making invites you on a time-bending fantasy journey \u2014\u2014 It tells the story of a boy named Grance, who is rushed to the hospital after an accident. But when he wakes, he finds himself in a world called &quot;the Tower&quot;... To return to his original world, players will step into Grance\u2019s shoes, embark on an unforeseen journey, and gradually unravel the secrets of this realm. **Exploration: Unlock the world\u2019s truths amid the mist** A high-difficulty exploration system: Each floor of the Tower is a distinct ecological realm \u2014 from lava hells to floating isles, mechanical metropolises to forgotten temples \u2014 all hiding mysterious gear and hidden bosses. A network of hidden side quests: Over dozens of deeply buried side missions, told through fragmented storytelling, weave together the joys and sorrows of the Tower\u2019s inhabitants. Complete them to unlock unique classes and challenge high-difficulty bosses. **Combat: Hone your edge through a thousand battles** Hundreds of distinct enemies: From mutated fiends lingering in the lower floors to ancient guardians defending the Tower\u2019s peak, each foe boasts unique attack patterns and weakness mechanics. Only strategic combinations can turn the tide. Endless possibilities in skills and classes: 32 character classes form a vast skill system. Each class pairs with unique skill chains, allowing for countless combat styles to be forged. **Progression: Forge your own legendary adventure** A collector\u2019s frenzy with thousands of gear pieces: From humble iron swords and leather armors to the &quot;Stellar Set&quot; \u2014 infused with the Tower\u2019s divine power \u2014 every piece comes with random affixes and upgrade potential. Exclusive artifacts drop from hidden bosses; &quot;ascended gear&quot; rewarded by side quests unlocks unique effects. A multi-dimensional progression system: Beyond traditional level and stat boosts, the &quot;Multi-Class System&quot; lets your character learn and combine skills from various classes. The Proficiency System permanently boosts all stats. Your progression strategy might even shape the story\u2019s ending. In this years-spanning epic adventure, are you ready to grip your weapon tight and carve Grance\u2019s path home through the Tower\u2019s endless floors?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u5192\u9669\u8005","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811580/c96c03d28123cf62b832061e1cca755fd53681d9.jpg"},{"name":"\u51b0\u4e4b\u7687\u51a0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811580/37b1af71009eb071eee686002936ea95c74d7cb7.jpg"},{"name":"\u738b\u4e4b\u529b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811580/26ca6fff8e9515b4c811dedb133f472520881b4c.jpg"},{"name":"\u661f\u706b\u6c38\u71c3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811580/3fdf79fc99c679e28f616f2b5c3c8408b8fb8fce.jpg"},{"name":"\u4ff1\u4e50\u90e8\u7279\u7ea7\u4f1a\u5458","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811580/a6937bea31e079f2c22665f73580ee5947f341af.jpg"},{"name":"\u6c38\u8fdc\u7684\u7ea6\u5b9a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811580/815b1b6f38a06913d4929f46998656dcae3c0646.jpg"},{"name":"\u65e0\u57a2\u4e4b\u6c34","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811580/83630f94d5f8b3034635989191992e2f87bf85dd.jpg"},{"name":"\u9ad8\u7ea7\u6280\u5de5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811580/f50a6efb5d6447e4ce070524c38f1b5cda053a63.jpg"},{"name":"\u8015\u5730","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811580/167734cc61d7c341c19d99365601e9acb4249351.jpg"},{"name":"\u8d77\u98ce\u4e86\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati