m to unlock unique classes and challenge high-difficulty bosses. **Combat: Hone your edge through a thousand battles** Hundreds of distinct enemies: From mutated fiends lingering in the lower floors to ancient guardians defending the Tower\u2019s peak, each foe boasts unique attack patterns and weakness mechanics. Only strategic combinations can turn the tide. Endless possibilities in skills and classes: 32 character classes form a vast skill system. Each class pairs with unique skill chains, allowing for countless combat styles to be forged. **Progression: Forge your own legendary adventure** A collector\u2019s frenzy with thousands of gear pieces: From humble iron swords and leather armors to the &quot;Stellar Set&quot; \u2014 infused with the Tower\u2019s divine power \u2014 every piece comes with random affixes and upgrade potential. Exclusive artifacts drop from hidden bosses; &quot;ascended gear&quot; rewarded by side quests unlocks unique effects. A multi-dimensional progression system: Beyond traditional level and stat boosts, the &quot;Multi-Class System&quot; lets your character learn and combine skills from various classes. The Proficiency System permanently boosts all stats. Your progression strategy might even shape the story\u2019s ending. In this years-spanning epic adventure, are you ready to grip your weapon tight and carve Grance\u2019s path home through the Tower\u2019s endless floors?</p>","developers":["qianyungame"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811580/1d7b97a2b706fac14723fedc9eba828439d4ae01/header.jpg?t=1763875301","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3811580/440797040/2e0ae2186b1d0db07a2c96b692ed40d239a0e885/1756879085/dash_av1.mpd?t=175688549